html", "value": "<p><strong>Effective 11/4/2025 - </strong>10c until 12/31/25; then 4c per month starting 01/01/2026. <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(39, 39, 39);\">Needs to be priced by 09/30/2026. If not priced by 09/30/2026 New Crop drop fee and monthly rates to apply.</span></p>"}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 4485, "date": "2025-08-21", "title": "25-26 Soybean DP Rates", "content": {"type": "text/html", "value": "<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 39, 39); font-size: 16px;\">Effective 10/09/2025</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(39, 39, 39); font-size: 16px;\"> For delivery starting 10/20/2025; 10c until 12/31/2025 then 5c per month starting on 01/01/2026. Needs to be priced by 09/30/2026. If not priced by 09/30/2026 New Crop drop fee and monthly rates to apply.</span></p>"}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 5091, "date": "2025-11-01", "title": "Soybean Aflatoxin testing", "content": {"type": "text/html", "value": "<p>Starting November 1st, we will test bean trucks going to east plant for aflatoxin. One in ten bean trucks will be tested for aflatoxin and result in a 10-15 minute wait before being dumped. Please be sure your CB is on the correct channel so probe can offer proper communication. </p><p> </p>"}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 6834, "date": "2026-09-01", "title": "26-27 Corn DP Rates", "content": {"type": "text/html", "value": "<p>20c drop fee starting 9/1/2026-12/31/2026, then 4c per month starting 1/1/2027 – needs to be priced by 9/30/2027 New Crop drop fee and monthly rates to apply </p><p> </p>"}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 6833, "date": "2026-09-02", "title": "26-27 Soybean DP Rates", "content": {"type": "text/html", "value": "<p>For delivery starting 9/16/2026 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">20c drop fee until 10/31/2026</span>, then 3c per month starting 11/1/2026 needs to be priced by 9/30/2027. New Crop drop fee and monthly rates to apply </p><p> </p>"}, "highlighted