"closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-20", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-21", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}], "timezone": {"name": "America/Chicago"}}, "announcements": [{"id": 6715, "date": "2026-08-03", "title": "Elevator Update", "content": {"type": "text/html", "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Dear Valued Customer,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Across ADM, we are always evaluating our footprint to ensure we have the right assets that align with the company’s long term strategic plan and operational needs. In some cases, this means moving away from facilities that are no longer a strategic fit within our organization. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">A short time ago, we informed colleagues at our Holland, Minnesota, grain elevator that we have entered into a binding agreement to sell our facility to D&amp;D Holland, LLC and end operations as ADM. We expect to complete this transaction mid-August.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Effective immediately, ADM Holland will no longer have any active grain bids and will no longer be accepting grain deliveries. If you have a current, open, to-arrive contract for bushels to be delivered into ADM Holland, we will contact you directly with next steps and additional options moving forward. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Please do not hesitate to contact me directly with questions or concerns. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Thank you,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Nicole Kolmer</span></p>"}, "highlighted": false}], "delivery_info": {"notice": null, "scale_hours": {"hours": [{"date": "2026-09-15", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-16", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-17", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-18", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-19", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-20", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-21", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"date": "2026-09-22", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}], "timezone": {"name": "America/Chicago"}}, "phone_number": null}, "phone_numbers": [], "user_permissions": [], "commodity_settings": {}, "bids_offers_enabled": true, "farmer_offers_enabled": false, "public_offers_enabled": false, "num_public_instruments": 4, "sustainability_enabled": {}, "promote_farmer_on_boarding": true, "enable_gradable_public_site": true}, {"id": 331847106, "urls": [{"url": "https://adm.file.force.com/sfc/dist/version/download/?oid=00Do0000000bGRN&ids=068Ps00001JG3o9&d=%2Fa%2FPs00000JQsJZ%2FxM1er68DJPYfFlY8sJbMsjymKLYHT6bhm0_rGH.f2.0&asPdf=false", "name": "2026 SRW Discount Schedule", "type": "Document"}, {"url": "https://adm.file.force.com/sfc/dist/version/download/?oid=00Do0000000bGRN&ids=068Ps00001Yw7Q7&d=%2Fa%2FPs00000OX0g9%2FYtyi2LKQfRmIM_8hhPmS2.GFtXV0BbBJouVhE4x8iB0&asPdf=false", "name": "2026 Corn Discount Schedule", "type": "Document"}, {"url": "https://adm.file.force.com/sfc/dist/version/download/?oid=00Do0000000bGRN&ids=068Ps00001YwUBK&d=%2Fa%2FPs00000OX14L%2F_1THXlqm5w6hVj3UVsggZu_0UT_qGWzg4T4sbc4_XGE&asPdf=fal